  "goodToKnow": "Einstecken means to put something in one's pocket (Geld, Schlüssel einstecken), to plug in (das Ladekabel einstecken) and to post a letter. Figuratively, it means to take punches, criticism or a defeat: Er kann austeilen, aber nicht einstecken (he can dish it out but can't take it). It can also mean to pocket money dishonestly. Separable: steckte ein, eingesteckt."
